### Create event (should return 201)
POST http://localhost:8000/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Winter Clothes Distribution",
  "description": "Distributing warm clothes to families in need before winter.",
  "eventType": "Donation",
  "thumbnail": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1488521787991-ed7bbaae773c",
  "location": "Mirpur 10, Dhaka",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-20",
  "creatorEmail": "test@example.com",
  "creatorName": "Test User"
}

### Past date (should return 400)
POST http://localhost:8000/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Old Event",
  "description": "This should fail.",
  "eventType": "Cleanup",
  "thumbnail": "https://example.com/a.jpg",
  "location": "Dhaka",
  "eventDate": "2026-01-01",
  "creatorEmail": "test@example.com"
}

### Get upcoming events (should return 200)
GET http://localhost:8000/events


### Get 6 recent upcoming events
GET http://localhost:8000/events/recent


### Get single event
GET http://localhost:8000/events/6ae9b52f2802c35b53f8db97

### Invalid id (should return 400)
GET http://localhost:8000/events/hello

### My events
GET http://localhost:8000/my-events?email=test@example.com

### My events without email (should return 400)
GET http://localhost:8000/my-events



### Update my event (should return 200)
PATCH http://localhost:8000/events/6ae9b52f2802c35b53f8db97
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "title": "Winter Clothes & Blanket Distribution",
  "description": "Distributing warm clothes and blankets to families in need.",
  "eventType": "Donation",
  "thumbnail": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1488521787991-ed7bbaae773c",
  "location": "Mirpur 10, Dhaka",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-22"
}

### Update someone else's event (should return 403)
PATCH http://localhost:8000/events/6ae9b52f2802c35b53f8db97
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hacker@example.com",
  "title": "Hacked",
  "description": "Should not work.",
  "eventType": "Donation",
  "thumbnail": "https://example.com/a.jpg",
  "location": "Nowhere",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-22"
}

### Delete someone else's event (should return 403)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/events/6ae9b6b7f4c547391f6ffe6e?email=hacker@example.com

### Delete my event (should return 200)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/events/6ae9b6b7f4c547391f6ffe6e?email=test@example.com


### Join event (should return 201)
POST http://localhost:8000/events/6ae9b52f2802c35b53f8db97/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userEmail": "volunteer@example.com",
  "userName": "Volunteer One"
}

### Join again (should return 409)
POST http://localhost:8000/events/6ae9b52f2802c35b53f8db97/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userEmail": "volunteer@example.com",
  "userName": "Volunteer One"
}


### My joined events
GET http://localhost:8000/joined-events?email=volunteer@example.com

### Join status: joined (should be true)
GET http://localhost:8000/events/6ae9b52f2802c35b53f8db97/join-status?email=volunteer@example.com

### Join status: not joined (should be false)
GET http://localhost:8000/events/6ae9b52f2802c35b53f8db97/join-status?email=someone@example.com


@token = paste_token_here

### No token (should return 401)
GET http://localhost:8000/my-events

### With token (should return 200)
GET http://localhost:8000/my-events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}